"Met-oosa is a tiny centenarian Artonan costumer, about four feet tall."
"She has dark purple-brown skin, beaded necklaces and square-rimmed glasses."
"She once owned the costume company and was a well-known local artist people thought dead."
"She dressed Alden Thorn as a black wizard Ryeh-b't at the gala to spite Bti-qwol."
"She signed the wing of Alden's costume and got her old theatrical pieces displayed."
